- Activity is concentrated both **between** and especially **near** the eventual **Mw 7.1** location.
- Preferred azimuths remain persistent across time windows, indicating **fault-guided triggering**.
- The figure visually supports the idea of **ongoing activation of the fault system leading toward the Mw 7.1 rupture area**.[0m

